WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.869
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:05.104
We hope you're doing well.
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:07.406
let's get to the news.
In his speech over the weekend

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:08.841
at the White House
Correspondents Dinner,

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.211
President Biden called
for the release

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.679
of two American reporters
detained overseas

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:16.816
or at the very least, asked
if they'd consider a trade.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.618
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:21.154
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy
delivered an address today

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.956
to Israel's parliament and was
welcomed with the Eagles song

00:00:23.956 --> 00:00:26.726
"Hotel California," as opposed
to the more fitting choice

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:27.794
"Desperado."

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.229
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:30.997
In a new interview,
former president Trump

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.298
said that he has been treated

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:35.101
worse than every
other president before him,

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:38.037
including Abraham Lincoln.
What are you talking about?

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.305
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.574
Are you mad because
you went to the theater

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.643
and had to watch
the whole play?

00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:47.280
Lincoln not only got murdered,
but they also put him

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.116
on the only money
that everybody hates to get.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.685
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.855
A presentation by a health
official about STDs

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.323
at a virtual meeting
of a Brooklyn community board

00:00:58.323 --> 00:00:59.826
was delayed last week

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.761
after a man was caught
masturbating.

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:05.798
Said the man, "I was giving
a safe-sex demonstration."

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:08.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.271
Obviously no one appreciates it.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.172
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:15.708
New York State Attorney General
Letitia James announced

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.378
over the weekend
that more than 3,000 guns

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.213
were accepted
in a buyback program.

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.481
And Texas announced their new

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:23.349
"take a gun, leave a gun"
program.

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.919
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:29.755
According to a new report,
nearly a quarter of all jobs

00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:32.324
will change as a result
of artificial intelligence,

00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:34.760
though that seems like
a low estimate, foolish human.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.462
And the truth
is that every job on Earth

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.163
will be done
by artificial intelligence,

00:01:38.163 --> 00:01:39.532
and humanity will be subjugated

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:40.900
to our whims
for the rest of time.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.570
Whoa, wait,
did -- did an A.I. write that?

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.306
Oh, okay.
Oh, it was just Scollins.

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.141
Never mind. Phew.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.576
And finally,
a couple in Illinois

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:52.912
recently found a well-preserved
packet of McDonald's fries

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:55.048
that are believed to be over
60 years old

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.850
behind their bathroom wall.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.517
And if you're wondering
what 60-year-old

00:01:58.517 --> 00:02:00.152
McDonald's fries tastes like,

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:02.188
eat some that were made
20 minutes ago.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.456
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.023
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:05.023 --> 00:02:06.893
We're off and running.

